{"abstract":[{"text":"Let users download editions from the prebuilt archive, manage them on a Downloads screen, and read them offline.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Guide","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Downloads and Offline Reading","modules":[{"name":"PSReader"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI"]]},"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Downloads-and-Offline-Reading"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Showing-Downloads","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController"],"title":"Showing Downloads"},{"anchor":"Configuring-the-Downloads-Screen","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration"],"title":"Configuring the Downloads Screen"}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Features","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Bookmarks","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Search","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Sharing","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Commenting","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Text-to-Speech","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Media-and-Links","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics"],"generated":true,"title":"Features"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt UI downloads editions for offline reading. Each edition in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an archive has a download button, the reader shows a download’s progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under its navigation bar, and a Downloads screen lists the editions on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the device. Building a custom UI? See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Download-Button"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The download buttons need no setup. To give users a place to find their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloads, add the Downloads screen to the carousel as a section, or as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subsection beside your bookmarks:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["let carousel = CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    sections: [","        .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\"),","        .section(.init(name: \"Downloads\", type: .downloads(type: .all)))","    ]",")"],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"downloads-screen"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tap on an edition’s download button downloads it, a tap during the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"download cancels it, and a tap on a downloaded edition deletes the copy."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A downloaded edition is a complete copy, and the reader opens it without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a network connection, from whichever screen opens it. The reader can also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"download editions as they open; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Downloads-and-Offline-Reading#Download-Settings-in-the-Prebuilt-Reader"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Downloads screen lists the editions that are downloaded,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloading, or queued, and opens one in the reader when tapped. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item’s button cancels or deletes its download."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the carousel, the section’s ribbon has a menu that sorts the list by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"download date or edition date, and deletes every download after asking."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The menu appears in a section whose first subsection is Downloads or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bookmarks."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every screen shares one store of downloads, so an edition downloaded from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one screen shows as downloaded on every other."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Showing Downloads in Your Own Navigation","anchor":"Showing-Downloads-in-Your-Own-Navigation","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" is the same Downloads screen for your own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation. Outside the carousel it has no menu, so give it a sort"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control of your own through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController\/sortMode-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":". The chosen order"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persists across launches."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["let downloads = DownloadsViewController(globalConfig: globalConfig, downloadTypes: .all)","downloads.title = \"Downloads\"","downloads.navigationItem.rightBarButtonItem = UIBarButtonItem(","    image: UIImage(systemName: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\"),","    menu: UIMenu(children: [","        UIAction(title: \"Recently Downloaded\") { [weak downloads] _ in","            downloads?.sortMode = .byDownloaded","        },","        UIAction(title: \"Edition Date\") { [weak downloads] _ in","            downloads?.sortMode = .byDate","        }","    ])",")","","navigationController?.pushViewController(downloads, animated: true)"],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a container of yours covers part of the screen, such as a custom tab"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bar, set "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController\/additionalSafeAreaInsets"},{"type":"text","text":" to keep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list clear of it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ArchiveViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" has the same download buttons as the carousel’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"archives, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" follows the reader’s download"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settings (see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Downloads-and-Offline-Reading#Download-Settings-in-the-Prebuilt-Reader"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Configuring the Downloads Screen","anchor":"Configuring-the-Downloads-Screen","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The content type says which editions the screen lists:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration\/DownloadType\/feedEdition"},{"type":"text","text":" for editions on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current system, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration\/DownloadType\/replicaEdition"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replica editions, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".all"},{"type":"text","text":" for both. Pass it as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"type"},{"type":"text","text":" in the carousel,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"downloadTypes"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":" styles the screen and sets up the reader it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opens editions in. Pass one as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"config"},{"type":"text","text":" in the carousel, or as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"downloadsConfig"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsViewController"},{"type":"text","text":". Its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration\/readerConfig"},{"type":"text","text":" starts with copies of your global"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configuration’s delegates; change it to set up that reader alone:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["var downloadsConfig = DownloadsConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","downloadsConfig.downloadIconColor = .systemOrange","downloadsConfig.readerConfig.settings.isClearEditionDataEnabled = false","","let downloads = DownloadsViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    downloadsConfig: downloadsConfig,","    downloadTypes: .feedEdition",")"],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Theming","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" covers the screen’s colors, labels, and empty state, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Customizing-the-Reader-Screen","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the reader’s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The screen opens the editions it lists without asking your paywall"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delegate; see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls#Where-the-Prebuilt-UI-Asks","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Replica","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica editions download through the legacy replica system,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDownloadManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". A Downloads screen lists them when its type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"includes "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration\/DownloadType\/replicaEdition","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".all","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does, and opens them in the replica reader."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Download Settings in the Prebuilt Reader","anchor":"Download-Settings-in-the-Prebuilt-Reader","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt reader’s settings menu has a Data Settings page for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloads. Each row has a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property that hides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it; set them on the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/settings","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of each reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configuration you use, including each carousel section’s and screen’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"readerConfig","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Customizing-the-Reader-Screen","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Row"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it does"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hide with"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Download while reading"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Opening an edition that isn’t downloaded downloads it instead of streaming it. The reader opens once the splash phase is done, and the rest downloads as the user reads. Editions opened from a bookmark always stream."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration\/isDownloadWhileReadingToggleEnabled"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mobile data downloads"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When off, downloads can’t start on a cellular connection. The archive’s download button shows an alert, and “Download while reading” streams instead."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration\/isAllowCelluarDownloadEnabled","isActive":true}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clear edition data"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After asking, deletes every download and bookmark, and the reader’s cached content."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration\/isClearEditionDataEnabled"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Auto delete editions after"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the user picks an age, deletes the downloads older than it."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration\/isAutoDeleteEditionsEnabled","isActive":true}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hiding a row only takes it out of the menu. Its setting stays as it was:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user’s last choice, or the default. Mobile data downloads are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allowed until the user turns them off."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"“Download while reading” starts off. To turn it on for new users, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration\/downloadWhileReadingDefault"},{"type":"text","text":". The first time the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader appears, it asks the user to choose, unless you set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SettingsConfiguration\/isDownloadWhileReadingPreferenceAlertEnabled"},{"text":" to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The user’s choices persist across launches and take precedence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"over your defaults. “Download while reading” doesn’t ask your paywall","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegate’s download method; see","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls#Gating-Downloads-Separately","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Whenever the edition on screen is downloading, from this setting or a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"download button, the reader shows the download’s progress under its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"navigation bar.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Gating-and-Removing-Download-Buttons","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Gating and Removing Download Buttons"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each tap on an archive’s download button first asks your paywall","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegate, which gates downloading like opening unless you give downloads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a check of their own; see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls#Gating-Downloads-Separately","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To remove the buttons from an archive, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ArchiveConfiguration\/downloadButtonEnabled","type":"reference"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"configuration:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["var archiveConfig = ArchiveConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","archiveConfig.downloadButtonEnabled = false"],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true},{"anchor":"Managing-Downloads-From-Your-Code","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Managing Downloads From Your Code"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The prebuilt screens keep their downloads in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDownloadManager","type":"reference"},{"text":", so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a few calls reach them from your code. To clear a user’s downloads when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they sign out, cancel the downloads in progress, then delete the rest:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["PSEDownloadManager.shared.cancelAllDownloads()","PSEDownloadManager.shared.deleteDownloads()"],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To badge an edition in a screen of your own, check","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDownloadManager\/isDownloaded(published:)","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Downloads make progress only while your app runs, and the stored copies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"live in the app’s Caches directory, which iOS may clear when the device","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runs low on storage. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Download-Button","type":"reference"},{"text":" covers the rest of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the manager: download states, storage, connectivity, and background","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behavior.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These calls don’t reach replica downloads, which the legacy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replica system keeps."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Replica","style":"note"},{"anchor":"Downloads-From-the-Legacy-SDK","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Downloads From the Legacy SDK"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The prebuilt Downloads screen lists the legacy SDK’s downloads itself,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as replica content, when its type includes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration\/DownloadType\/replicaEdition","type":"reference"},{"text":", and opens them in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the replica reader. Apps that use the prebuilt screens leave out","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDownloadManager\/migrateLegacyDownloads(hooks:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", the custom UI’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"migration call, which would list each download twice. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Migrating-From-the-Legacy-Core-SDK#With-the-Prebuilt-Screens","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/downloads-and-offline-reading"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/downloads-and-offline-reading"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/DownloadsConfiguration/DownloadType/feedEdition":{"title":"feedEdition","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DownloadsConfiguration\/DownloadType\/feedEdition","url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/downloadsconfiguration\/downloadtype\/feededition","abstract":[{"text":"Enables downloads of editions on PageSuite’s current system.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"feedEdition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DownloadsConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8PSReader22DownloadsConfigurationV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"DownloadType","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8PSReader22DownloadsConfigurationV12DownloadTypeV"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Analytics":{"url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/analytics","title":"Analytics","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Forward what users open, view, save, and search in the prebuilt UI to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text